,"id":37456,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Her Blue Sky","logo":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/1bc72b11-b469-4ac7-94bc-0b59c8bf6ef3.png","image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/b7376589-7ac7-4ce3-9826-5b995d891269.jpg","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/2acc8474-4803-46bf-bcdf-a85293cffc1e.jpg","likes":49,"dislikes":3,"views":3194,"release_date":"1570752000000","length":6391,"description":"High school student Aoi Aioi lives with her elder sister, Akane, after a tragic accident took their parents away 13 years ago. Because Akane has since been taking care of her single-handedly, Aoi wants to move to Tokyo after her graduation to relieve her sister's burden and pursue a musical career, inspired by Akane's ex-boyfriend Shinnosuke \"Shinno\" Kanamuro. Shinno was part of a band until he left for Tokyo to become a professional guitarist after the sisters' parents passed away, and he was never to be seen again.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.8}],"value":6.8,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":995768,"background_color":"#3c64b4","content_control":"FAMILY"}}